アンコール、もし知ってたら
For the encore, if you know it,

915
01:01:15,767 --> 01:01:18,837
一つの可能な歌
there's only one song we can do!

916
01:01:18,837 --> 01:01:20,037
ヒーロー！！
Hero!!

917
01:01:33,862 --> 01:01:38,362
ONE PUNCH!

918
01:01:40,762 --> 01:01:45,562
(Three! Two! One! Kill shot!)

919
01:01:43,662 --> 01:01:45,562
参上！必勝！至上最強！！
Appearing! Certain victory! The supreme strongest!!

920
01:01:46,362 --> 01:01:49,862
なんだってんだ? フラストレーション 僕は止まらない
What're ya saying? Frustration. I won't stop.

921
01:01:50,562 --> 01:01:52,562
ONE PUNCH! 完遂! 連戦連勝!
ONE PUNCH! Complete! A succession of victories!

922
01:01:54,562 --> 01:01:58,062
僕は喝!! 常に勝つ!! 圧勝!!
I shout out!! I always win!! Complete victory!!

923
01:01:58,562 --> 01:02:02,062
Power! Get power! ギリギリ限界まで
Power! Get power! To the limit!

924
01:02:02,562 --> 01:02:08,562
HERO 俺を讃える声や 喝采なんて 欲しくはないさ
Hero, I don't want voices praising me or acclamation.

925
01:02:09,562 --> 01:02:14,562
HERO だから 人知れず 悪と闘う
Hero, that's why I fight evil in secret.

926
01:02:18,562 --> 01:02:20,362
(Nobody knows who he is.)

927
01:02:20,562 --> 01:02:26,562
天(そら)覆い 押し寄せる敵 俺は背中は向けはしない
Enemies closing in, covering the sky, I won't turn my back on them.

928
01:02:27,562 --> 01:02:32,562
HERO ならば 揺るぎなき覚悟したため 繰り出せ鉄拳
If I'm a hero, then I've prepared unwavering resolve, so I'll unleash my fists.

929
01:02:34,762 --> 01:02:38,762
(Three! Two! One! Fight back!)

930
01:02:43,062 --> 01:02:45,062
参上! Go on! 正々堂々!!
Appearing! Go on! Fair and square!!

931
01:02:45,562 --> 01:02:49,062
どうなってんだ? なにも感じねぇ もはや敵居ねぇー!
What's happening? I don't feel anything. My enemies are gone now!

932
01:02:50,562 --> 01:02:54,062
JUSTICE! 執行! 問答無用!
Justice! Enforcement! No use arguing about it!

933
01:02:54,562 --> 01:02:58,562
俺が断つ!! 悪を断つ!! 合掌!!
I'll cut it off!! Cut off evil!! Hands together in prayer!!

934
01:02:59,562 --> 01:03:02,562
Power! Get power! アドレナリン溢れ出すぜ!
Power! Get power! Adrenaline's overflowing!

935
01:03:02,562 --> 01:03:09,562
Power! Get power! 鍛えた技をぶちかませ!
Power! Get power! Strike hard with tempered technique!

936
01:03:10,562 --> 01:03:14,562
HERO どんなに 強い奴も ちっぽけなガキだったんだ
Hero, no matter how strong the enemy, they used to be tiny brats.

937
01:03:15,562 --> 01:03:18,062
HERO 弱き 己乗り越え 強くなる
Hero, I overcome my weak self and get stronger.

938
01:03:18,562 --> 01:03:20,362
(Nobody knows who he is.)

939
